  "tosafot": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>נִכְסַי לְהַאי דִּמְעַבְּרַתְּ.</b></big> בשכיב מרע איירי מדקאמר עלה ולוקמה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "370px",
      "right": "80px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כר' יוחנן בן ברוקה ורבי יוחנן בן ברוקה בשכיב מרע",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "איירי מדקא בעי לעיל (<a href=\"/bava_batra/131a\">דף קלא.</a>) עליה בבריא היאך? ואע''ג דדברי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שכיב מרע ככתובין וכמסורין דמו. לא מהני מידי כיון דבבריא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לא מהני אפילו ע''י קנין. ואע''ג",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דאמר לקמן (<a href=\"/bava_batra/148a\">דף קמח.</a>) שכ''מ שאמר",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הלואתו לפלוני הלואתו לפלוני אע''ג",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דליתיה בבריא אפילו בקנין דאי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "איתיה בבריא בקנין אם כן הוי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שכיב מרע ובריא שוין! מ''מ הכא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ליתא בשכ''מ כיון דליתא בבריא בקנין",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דכולהו לא בחדא מחתא מחתינהו:",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:7:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>אֵיתִיבֵיהּ רַב נַחְמָן <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Huna (רב הונא) — second/third-generation Amora, principal disciple of Rav and head of Sura\" data-authority-id=\"895\" data-full-name=\"Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רַב הוּנָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"rav_huna_early_circle\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Identified as Rav Huna of Sura (895): the immediate sugya pairs him with his documented contemporaries and disciples, and per Rashi (Yevamot 83b) the plain «רב הונא» is this Rav Huna.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;contextual&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Rav-disciple-era interlocutor&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;The immediate sugya pairs this Rav Huna with his documented contemporaries and disciples at Sura (the circle of Rav&#x27;s students), matching the profile of the famous Rav Huna (895), not the later Rav-Ashi-circle homonym.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology contextual review (2026-07)&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;scholarly_source&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Setam-Rav-Huna principle&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Rashi (Yevamot 83b) and Hyman rule that a plain, unqualified «רב הונא» is certainly the famous Rav Huna of Sura — «אבל היכי דאתמר סתמא ודאי הוא ר\\&quot;ה». No later or patronymic qualifier is present here.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Rashi, Yevamot 83b s.v. אמרי בי רב (with Hyman, s.v. רב הונא)&quot;}]\">לְרַב הוּנָא</span>.</b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "130px",
      "right": "120px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ואם תאמר אדפריך",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "רב נחמן <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Huna (רב הונא) — second/third-generation Amora, principal disciple of Rav and head of Sura\" data-authority-id=\"895\" data-full-name=\"Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רַב הוּנָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"rav_huna_early_circle\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Identified as Rav Huna of Sura (895): the immediate sugya pairs him with his documented contemporaries and disciples, and per Rashi (Yevamot 83b) the plain «רב הונא» is this Rav Huna.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;contextual&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Rav-disciple-era interlocutor&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;The immediate sugya pairs this Rav Huna with his documented contemporaries and disciples at Sura (the circle of Rav&#x27;s students), matching the profile of the famous Rav Huna (895), not the later Rav-Ashi-circle homonym.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology contextual review (2026-07)&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;scholarly_source&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Setam-Rav-Huna principle&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Rashi (Yevamot 83b) and Hyman rule that a plain, unqualified «רב הונא» is certainly the famous Rav Huna of Sura — «אבל היכי דאתמר סתמא ודאי הוא ר\\&quot;ה». No later or patronymic qualifier is present here.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Rashi, Yevamot 83b s.v. אמרי בי רב (with Hyman, s.v. רב הונא)&quot;}]\">לרב הונא</span> תקשי ליה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לנפשיה דאית ליה לקמן המזכה לעובר",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לא קנה! וי''ל דהוא מוקי מתניתין",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לכשתלד דסבירא ליה לקמן לכשתלד",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קנה. אי נמי רב נחמן איירי בעובר",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שאינו בנו ומוקי מתניתין בבנו דדעתו",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "של אדם קרובה אצל בנו כר' יוחנן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לקמן. וכן פסקו רבינו חננאל ורשב''ם",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וה''ג דבבנו המזכה לעובר קנה.",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>דִּתְנַן: <span class=\"dh-divergent\">העובר</span> פּוֹסֵל <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ואין</span> מַאֲכִיל.</b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "160px",
      "right": "90px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פירש רשב''ם פוסל עבדי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אביו מלאכול בתרומה דעובר במעי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אמו זר ואינו מאכיל את אמו דילוד",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מאכיל ושאינו ילוד אינו מאכיל, ורש''י",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פירש ביבמות (<a href=\"/yevamot/67a\">דף סז.</a>) בענין אחר",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פוסל את אמו כהנת אם הוא זר",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ואינו מאכיל את אמו אם הוא כהן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "במעי זרה דעובר במעי זרה זר הוא.",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ולהאי פירוש לא מוכח הכא מידי! אבל",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אין לפרש כלל פוסל עבדי אביו אם",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הוא זר במעי כהנת ואינו מאכיל",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עבדי אביו אם הוא כהן במעי זרה!",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דחדא מילתא היא דהא פשיטא דכיון",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דאם הוא כהן אינו מאכיל כ''ש אם",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הוא ישראל ולא הוה ליה למיתני",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פוסל אלא אינו מאכיל!",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>וְלֵימָא לֵיהּ: <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ר&#x27;</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">יוחנן</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">בן</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ברוקה</span></b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "160px",
      "right": "90px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>היא</b></big>. תימה דאמאי נקט",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "רבי יוחנן בן ברוקה דאפילו רבנן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מודו דבלשון מתנה מועיל! ויש לומר דכיון דראוי ליורשו",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "והוא לא הזכיר לשון מתנה אם כן בירושה קאמר:",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Bava Batra 141b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    }
  ],
